GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/medical-observations/astronauts/1?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

### Read an observation and its change history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/medical-observations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/medical-observations/1/history?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

