GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dashboard/astronauts/1/trends?from=2025-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2025-01-08T00:00:00Z&type=HEART_RATE
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

