Authorization: Bearer {{missionControlAccessToken}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dashboard/missions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{missionControlAccessToken}}

### Expected 403: mission control cannot access raw astronaut readings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health/astronauts/1/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{missionControlAccessToken}}

### Expected 403: mission control cannot read private medical observations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/medical-observations/astronauts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{missionControlAccessToken}}

### @name uploadWellbeingAudio
# Replace the file path with a valid audio/webm recording; max upload size is configurable.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports/audio-drafts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=AstroAudioBoundary

--AstroAudioBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="recording.webm"
Content-Type: audio/webm

< ./replace-with-valid-audio.webm
--AstroAudioBoundary--

### Preview an unsubmitted audio draft (owner only)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports/audio-drafts/{{wellbeingAudioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Delete an unsubmitted recording (owner only; use before attaching it to a report)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports/audio-drafts/{{wellbeingAudioId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### @name submitWellbeingReport
# Submit a report with audio; reportText may be null when audio is attached.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "STRESSED",
  "reportText": "Example report for local workflow verification.",
  "audioRecordingId": {{wellbeingAudioId}}
}

### Astronaut's own well-being report history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports/mine?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Medical officer inbox (only assigned astronauts)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports/inbox?status=SUBMITTED&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

### Edit a report while it is still SUBMITTED
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports/{{wellbeingReportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "STRESSED",
  "reportText": "Updated report text before review.",
  "audioRecordingId": null
}

### Authorized medical officer/admin playback (private; not a public URL)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports/{{wellbeingReportId}}/audio
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

### Begin review and add a private medical observation
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports/{{wellbeingReportId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "UNDER_REVIEW",
  "reviewNotes": "Private review note.",
  "observationText": "Private observation entered by the assigned medical officer.",
  "followUpAssigneeId": null,
  "followUpDueDate": null
}

### Assign a follow-up (choose an assigned medical officer ID and a future date)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports/{{wellbeingReportId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "FOLLOW_UP_REQUIRED",
  "reviewNotes": "Follow-up is required.",
  "observationText": null,
  "followUpAssigneeId": 2,
  "followUpDueDate": "2026-12-01"
}

### Close a report after follow-up is complete
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/wellbeing/reports/{{wellbeingReportId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CLOSED",
  "reviewNotes": "Workflow completed.",
  "observationText": null,
  "followUpAssigneeId": null,
  "followUpDueDate": null
}

### @name listNotifications
# In-app notifications for the authenticated user only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

###
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

### Medical officer pending follow-up inbox
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/medical-observations/follow-ups/inbox?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

### CSV health, alert, follow-up, and well-being exports are permission checked
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/astronauts/1/health?from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-11-15T00:00:00Z&format=CSV
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/alerts?astronautId=1&format=CSV
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/astronauts/1/follow-ups?format=CSV
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/astronauts/1/wellbeing?format=CSV
Authorization: Bearer {{medicalOfficerAccessToken}}

### PDF mission operational summary (administrator or mission control; no raw readings or observations)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reports/missions/1?format=PDF
Authorization: Bearer {{missionControlAccessToken}}

### Administrator audit history (passwords, tokens, report text, and audio contents are not logged)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/audit-events?page=0&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
